{"id":"cdef6425f447218384e1724c41288fa2af13f14e","url":"https://www.v2ex.com/t/1240813","title":"黄鱼的 Claude 号被封，任务没做完，换 Codex 能接的上吗？","site_name":"Info Flow","source":"V2EX (创意工作者社区)","byline":"jacketma","excerpt":"Claude - @jacketma - 小黄鱼上搞的 Claude 号，结果一觉醒来，号没了，任务也没做完已经废了好几个 Claude 号了，不想继续折腾，免得到时候任务没完了，号又没了。Openai 家风控松一点，换 Co","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div id=\"Main\">\n                \n                \n<div><p>小黄鱼上搞的 Claude 号，结果一觉醒来，号没了，任务也没做完</p><p>已经废了好几个 Claude 号了，不想继续折腾，免得到时候任务没完了，号又没了。</p><p>Openai 家风控松一点，换 Codex 接着干，能接的上吗？</p></div>\n\n<!-- SOL tip topic -->\n\n\n\n\n\n<div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18068311\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/b2e0/b2cf/175571_normal.png?m=1761316400\" alt=\"uqf0663\" data-uid=\"175571\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>1</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/uqf0663\">uqf0663</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-09 21:34:13 +08:00\">22h 31m ago</span>  &#160; <span><img src=\"/static/img/heart_20250818.png?v=c3415183a0b3e9ab1576251be69d7d6d\" width=\"14\" alt=\"❤️\"> 1</span>\n                    \n                    <p>我上次被封号临时切 DeepSeek 叫他输出一份交接文档，然后在 codex 直接导入这份文档，一点问题都没有</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18068797\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/0d06ae535981b08dc9c596b39b33fdde?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"buruoyanyang\" data-uid=\"461165\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>2</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/buruoyanyang\">buruoyanyang</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-10 08:21:04 +08:00\">11h 45m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>直接让 CodeX 读一下 Claude 的对话记录，甚至你说另一个 AI ，有时候都能给你猜到 <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://i.imgur.com/rjR4rdr.png\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/rjR4rdr.png\" rel=\"noreferrer\"></a></p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18068802\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/4105/08ab/73070_normal.png?m=1762737894\" alt=\"luckyc\" data-uid=\"73070\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>3</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/luckyc\">luckyc</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-10 08:25:05 +08:00\">11h 41m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>这就是我为什么喜欢 opencode 的原因, 上游随便接.</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18069804\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/9dc4/9cf9/615698_normal.png?m=1786094146\" alt=\"ranfenghs\" data-uid=\"615698\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>4</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/ranfenghs\">ranfenghs</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-10 10:54:39 +08:00\">9h 11m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>我正好空一个 48 月 team,可拉人,80r/月,楼主可私信</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18071628\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/3baa/a944/800854_normal.png?